-peak","u":"ms"},{"d":"ae-ptfdur","k":"number","l":"V1 terminal force duration","u":"ms"},{"d":"ae-ptfdepth","k":"number","l":"V1 terminal force depth","u":"mm"},{"d":"ae-ampii","k":"number","l":"P amplitude, lead II","u":"mm"},{"d":"ae-ampv1","k":"number","l":"P amplitude, V1","u":"mm"}],"ats-idsa-cap":[{"d":"ai-major-vp","k":"bool","l":"Major: septic shock requiring vasopressors"},{"d":"ai-major-mv","k":"bool","l":"Major: respiratory failure requiring mechanical ventilation"},{"d":"ai-rr","k":"bool","l":"Minor: respiratory rate >= 30/min"},{"d":"ai-pf","k":"bool","l":"Minor: PaO2/FiO2 <= 250"},{"d":"ai-multi","k":"bool","l":"Minor: multilobar infiltrates"},{"d":"ai-conf","k":"bool","l":"Minor: confusion / disorientation"},{"d":"ai-bun","k":"bool","l":"Minor: uremia (BUN >= 20 mg/dL)"},{"d":"ai-leuk","k":"bool","l":"Minor: leukopenia (WBC < 4 x10^9/L)"},{"d":"ai-plt","k":"bool","l":"Minor: thrombocytopenia (platelets < 100 x10^9/L)"},{"d":"ai-hypo","k":"bool","l":"Minor: hypothermia (core temp < 36 C)"},{"d":"ai-fluid","k":"bool","l":"Minor: hypotension requiring aggressive fluids"}]}